Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "originalUrl": ""
}

### Analytics agregado do link de teste - esperado: 200 OK com TotalClicks e agrupamentos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/links/{{code}}/analytics

### Analytics de link inexistente - esperado: 404 Not Found
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/links/ZzZzZz9/analytics

